# Build context for the .NET images: the repository root, so every pattern is written for
# it. Patterns without ** are anchored at the context root. Excluding bin and obj keeps
# Windows build output out of the cache key of the COPY src/ layer, and a Windows
# project.assets.json out of a Linux SDK image.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/

# The SPA is built by its own image from its own context; the backend images never touch it.
src/DM.Web.Client/

test/
docs/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
README.md
